$(function(){$("#loaderbody").addClass("hide");$(document).bind("ajaxStart",function(){$("#loaderbody").removeClass("hide")}).bind("ajaxStop",function(){$("#loaderbody").addClass("hide")})});showInPopup=(n,t)=>{$.ajax({type:"GET",url:n,success:function(n){$("#form-modal .modal-body").html(n);$("#form-modal .modal-title").html(t);$("#form-modal").modal("show")},error:function(n){n.status===401?window.location.href="/Identity/Account/Login":alert("An error occurred while loading the form.")}})};jQueryAjaxPost=n=>{try{$.ajax({type:"POST",url:n.action,data:new FormData(n),contentType:!1,processData:!1,success:function(n){n.isValid?($("#view-all").html(n.html),$("#form-modal .modal-body").html(""),$("#form-modal .modal-title").html(""),$("#form-modal").modal("hide"),$.notify("Submitted Successfully",{globalPosition:"top centre",className:"Success"})):$("#form-modal .modal-body").html(n.html)},error:function(n){console.log(n)}})}catch(t){console.log(t)}return!1};jQueryAjaxDelete=n=>{if(confirm("Are you sure to this record?"))try{$.ajax({type:"POST",url:n.action,data:new FormData(n),contentType:!1,processData:!1,success:function(n){$("#view-all").html(n.html);$.notify("Deleted Successfully",{globalPosition:"top centre",className:"Success"})},error:function(n){console.log(n)}})}catch(t){console.log(t)}return!1};document.addEventListener("DOMContentLoaded",function(){const n=document.getElementById("sidebarToggle"),t=document.getElementById("wrapper");n&&n.addEventListener("click",function(n){n.preventDefault();t.classList.toggle("toggled")})});